{
 "$schema": "_plan.schema.json",
 "format": "plx-investigate-plan/v1",
 "id": "landed_cost",
 "families": [
  "F7"
 ],
 "title": "Landed cost of a purchase order, line by line, with every unknown visible",
 "description": "Goods, freight and duty of any purchase order from projected cited values, computed by operating/landed_cost.py. Goods: each line's cited unit price per its cited unit times its ordered quantity; a $0.000 line takes the cited amount of the proforma naming the PO (a lead) when it is that line's alone; differing proformas: PI_VERSION_UNRESOLVED; an unread amount: PI_AMOUNT_UNREAD; none picked. Freight: the Portal's allocatePoFreightPerUnit (plx-customer-portal@6e76a5b project-landed-quote.ts:915-941) of the header shipping estimate over a fully received purchase order, or the receipt's posted actual; every freight step names its basis. Each forwarder quote naming the PO (a lead) is its own entry: its stated total is never multiplied, a per-container rate only by a cited container count; total freight only when its cited scope covers origin, main carriage and destination, it is valid on the as-of date and, priced per container, the count is cited; a destination-only, tax-excluded or expired quote stays a typed gap and is never allocated as the header estimate. Duty: a receipt actual or a cited rate; before receipt, the tariff_c (SupplierItem.tariff_rate, finance) of the item's FileMaker row offered by the order's own supplier, written with its unit and re-read for the reader (empty: absent); else HS_CODE_NOT_CITED or DUTY_RATE_SOURCE_ABSENT. FM hscode, countryoforigin and tierpricing are not served. Stages (LOG-09): counts of the confirmations, forwarder quotes, receipts, purchase invoices, vendor payments and G/L entries the walk reached, one count per binding; a stage nothing reached is not counted as zero. Packaging: cases per line from the item's units per case (differing records: UNITS_PER_CASE_CONFLICT); case dimensions (app_product_pack_spec) are not served, so no container count is derived. Two currencies, an unknown denominator, an unreceived line or a missing estimate leave the line and total null, typed. An analytic estimate, not item cost (ERP-D-015).",
 "root": {
  "object_types": [
   "PurchaseOrder"
  ],
  "fallback_filters": [
   {
    "object_type": "PurchaseOrder",
    "property": "po_number"
   }
  ]
 },
 "step_budget": 128,
 "max_each": 50,
 "steps": [
