     "below_tier_floor"
    ],
    "set_args": {
     "tier_floor": "lead"
    },
    "note_gap": "lead_tier_links_followed"
   },
   "description": "The order's records that name this one as their twin (a Business Central order's Portal record names it by custom_fields.renumberedTo, a lead by PO number text): same_record_as is read only from the naming side, so a BC root reaches its Portal header, and its shipping and duty estimates, only in reverse."
  },
  {
